## Why This Is Asked
Tests designing a monocular system that operates in a dynamic warehouse, combining SLAM with object pose estimation, plus on-device few-shot adaptation under tight latency.

## Key Concepts
- Monocular SLAM with dynamic object handling
- 6-DoF pose estimation for rigid objects
- On-device 5-shot adaptation (meta-learning prototypes)
- Synthetic+real data with domain randomization
- Efficient losses: reprojection, pose consistency, temporal coherence

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code for data association and pose update
function updatePose(frame, map, adptModel) {
  const detections = adptModel.detect(frame);
  const associations = associate(detections, map);
  map.updateWithObservations(associations);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
